.DS_Store

# Datasheet PDFs are re-fetchable from source_url in datasheets/<MPN>.json (sha256 there to verify).
# The JSON summaries stay tracked: they are the working copy (PCB-WORKFLOW.md section 2).
datasheets/*.pdf

# Exceptions: no stable automated download (Excelitas and ADI block scripted downloads; the VTH2110 copy
# came from a JLCPCB mirror with an expiring link, the ADI PDFs were supplied by the user).
!datasheets/VTH2110.pdf
!datasheets/ADA4530-1.pdf
!datasheets/ADA4817-1.pdf
